Figure 3 shows what decided each quote. On XAUUSD, XAGUSD, and EURUSD most volumes came from RISK. USDJPY was cut by OPEN_RISK in 11 of 19 quotes. Its quote often came later in the day than gold and silver, so it got what was left of the budget. NVT was capped by MARGIN in 52 of 54 quotes. AUS200 was refused 54 times because the budget was full, and ESP35 was refused every day. On ESP35 the minimum volume is 1 lot, and 1 lot with a 0.5% stop loses 109 to 118 USD. That loss is more than 1% of the balance from the first day on. The refusal follows from the settings, and the log line names the cap that refused the trade.
